{"type":"message","id":"c3f6d039","parentId":"3e981974","timestamp":"2026-02-02T21:41:32.963Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01QDgW8R6p1gx2pWia6c8scA","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# FINISH SCHEDULE - Complete Extraction\n\n## 7th Floor\n\n### Room 704 - Dining Room\n| Surface | Material | Finish | Color/Remarks |\n|---------|----------|--------|---------------|\n| Floor | Existing to remain | Existing to remain | Existing to remain |\n| Walls | Gypsum Board, Existing to remain | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Ceiling | Gypsum Board, Existing to remain | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Crown | Existing to remain | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Window Jamb, Sill and Head | Existing to remain | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Window Apron | Existing to remain | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Fireplace | Existing to remain | Existing to remain | |\n| Mantel & Hearth | Existing to remain | | |\n| Base | Wood, Existing to remain | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Floor | Wood, Existing to remain | Stained & Sealed | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer / SEE DRAWING A-103 |\n| Walls | Gypsum Board, Existing to remain | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Ceiling | Gypsum Board, Existing to remain | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n\n### Room 706 - Sitting Room\n| Surface | Material | Finish | Color/Remarks |\n|---------|----------|--------|---------------|\n| Floor | Wood, Existing to remain | Stained & Sealed | Match to Existing Floor / SEE DRAWING A-103 |\n| Walls | Gypsum Board, Existing to remain | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Ceiling | Gypsum Board, Existing to remain | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Window Jambs, Sill, Head | Existing to remain | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Window Apron | Existing to remain | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Casing | Wood, Existing to remain | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Base"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/mitsui-838-5th-ave/pages/arch_page_042.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770068492957}}
{"type":"message","id":"788df3d8","parentId":"c3f6d039","timestamp":"2026-02-02T21:41:45.122Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01ViFsS72SZjttCVRhewtjMB","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# FINISH SCHEDULE - Complete Extraction\n\n## Notes:\n1. Mold & Moisture Resistant Gyp. Board to be used at all wet locations\n2. Cement board to be used at stone/tile wall and ceiling applications\n3. All plywood used in partitions as blocking/bracing must be fire-rated or must be sandwiched between masonry, plaster, or wallboard and not be exposed to air\n\n---\n\n## Room 721A - Closet\n\n| Surface | Material | Finish | Color/Remarks |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Floor | Wood | Stained & Sealed | Match to Existing Floor |\n| Walls | Gypsum Board | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Ceiling | Gypsum Board | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Base | Wood | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Casing | Wood | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Millwork | Wood | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer, Hanging Rod Finish TBD |\n\n## Room 722 - Primary Sitting Room\n\n| Surface | Material | Finish | Color/Remarks |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Floor | Wood | Stained & Sealed | Match to Existing Floor |\n| Walls | Gypsum Board | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Ceiling | Gypsum Board | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Base | Wood | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Casing | Wood | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Window Jambs, Sill, Head | Existing to remain | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Window Apron | | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n| Stair Treads | Existing to remain | Stained | Existing to remain |\n| Stair Risers | Existing to remain | Paint | Existing to remain |\n| Panelled Jamb at 722 | Wood | Paint | See Paint Schedule By Interior Designer |\n\n## Room 722A - Closet\n\n| Surface | Material | Finish | Color/Remarks |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Mill"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/mitsui-838-5th-ave/pages/arch_page_043.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770068505105}}
